WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:09.200
6... 7... 8...

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.520
9... 10...

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.860
11...

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.440
I guess I'll hide here.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.760
Sorry. I'll go somewhere else.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.130
Not now. The cops team is here.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:39.970
Uh oh!

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:48.150
<i>He smelled like shampoo... 
and a little like sweat.</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.400
<i>It set my heart racing.</i>

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.700
You stay here, Yoshioka-san.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:03.080
I knew it! There was a robber there!

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.250
Get him!

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.210
Don't let him get away!

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:10.170
He got caught...

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.420
It's my fault.

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:16.970
I've got to save him!

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:40.940
Um...

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.330
Thank you.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.760
Sure.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:53.020
<i>We can't go back to those days.</i>

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:29.430
You brought a lunch again today, Futaba?

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.850
It's still a little uncomfortable 
to go to the school store for it.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.400
Oh, that old lady?

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:39.250
But it sure is lucky that guy 
saw what happened, right?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.320
Really!

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.500
It's no laughing matter!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:46.530
You guys doubted me at first, too!

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.140
What were we supposed to do?

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.340
We didn't see it, after all.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.250
<b>Ridiculous</b>

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.250
<b>Ha
ha
ha</b>

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.250
<b>Mental Picture Artist: Futaba</b>

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.250
<i>You're just playing at friendship.</i>

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.750
What are you doing, Futaba?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.530
Hey, Makita!

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.740
Not eating your lunch in the classroom again?

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.430
Where do you always eat it?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:10.570
Outside... with my friends 
from another class.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.090
It's like a picnic. It's fun!

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.700
Oh boy!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.130
That picked me right up!

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.420
She pisses me off.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.860
Why can't boys see through 
her cutesy girl act?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.780
Hey, daily rep.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:27.050
Yes?

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:29.640
I'm handing back your notes and print-outs,

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.240
so head to the teachers' office to get them.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:32.620
Ah... yes, sir.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:38.460
Wow, there must be a lot 
of notes and print-outs.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:40.300
Then let's go together.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.160
Go for it, Futaba!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.790
Have fun!

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:48.890
So cold!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.060
<i>Makita-san?</i>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:04.050
On a day like this, you should eat inside.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:07.960
But the sun is out. It's nice and warm.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:10.450
Liar! It's really cold out here.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.670
<i>I guess she really is just naturally cute.</i>

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.590
Ah! Just like mine.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:30.220
Um, you can have this 
if you want. I have two.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.560
Oh? But it doesn't fit with my character.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.700
It has nothing to do with character!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:37.440
Here.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.400
Th-Thanks.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:44.110
<i>Wow, her hands are really cold.</i>

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:47.150
Thanks for talking to me.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.920
I know everyone finds me really annoying.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:56.840
I know I put on a cutesy girl act, but...

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:01.650
When I'm in front of boys, 
I get so nervous, I just do it.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.550
But everyone puts on nice clothes and

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:09.460
makeup to look good for other people, right?

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.220
So I wonder, what's the difference

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:16.730
between that and me wanting 
boys to think I'm cute?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.860
Umm, I think there might be 
something weird about the

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.070
"wanting people to like me" vector 
only applying to boys...

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:32.480
<i>Wait... My "wanting people to like me" 
vector only applies to girls... right?</i>

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:38.220
I don't mean to say people are wrong 
for finding me annoying,

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:42.420
but in exchange, 
I want to act the way I like.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.460
Here. Take this hand warmer.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.360
Thanks for the bunny strap. 
This is cheap by comparison, but...

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.270
Thanks for the strap, okay?

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:08.570
<i>I see. I guess you could call me 
a reverse-cutesy girl, then.</i>

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:15.080
Hey, are you listening?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.470
I told you I am.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:21.080
You've got to bounce back 
before the term ends, okay?

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:23.650
What are you doing about your grades?

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.960
<i>Tanaka-kun and Tanaka-sensei...</i>

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.750
You can't stay on the 
advanced course like that.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:33.220
<i>Advanced course?! So Tanaka-kun is 
an elite taking advanced courses?!</i>

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:37.170
What are you looking at?

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.870
I'm not looking!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:46.920
Please enter the faculty 
room more quietly.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.340
Sorry.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.000
<b>Ugh...</b>

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:07.520
That looks hard to manage by yourself.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:12.550
Your friends-in-name-only 
didn't help you, I guess?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.680
If you think it looks hard, 
why don't you help me?

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.520
Huh... no.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:19.640
Kou!

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:22.400
Annoying. Bye.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:24.850
He really isn't gonna help me!

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.310
<i>Awful boy!</i>

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:31.810
Geez. Sorry about him.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:36.200
I'll help you. Where's your class?

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.390
Are you Kou's friend?

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:42.780
We went to middle school together.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:45.830
Though... that was a while back.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:47.830
I see!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.050
I see, I see.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:56.300
<i>Why does Tanaka-sensei look so happy?</i>

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.520
<i>He's got some real bed head, too...</i>

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:02.030
I know how he can be, 
but please be friendly with him.

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.180
Don't be silly!

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.280
<i>Stop searching for the old Tanaka-kun!</i>

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.210
Class 2 is there, right?

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:17.530
Well, I've got some 
business to tend to above.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.280
Right! Thanks for the help.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.330
Hey, Murao!

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.710
Murao!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:44.380
Did you say you're not coming 
to the after-test karaoke party?

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:45.390
Yeah.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.600
You're skipping out on 
all class get-togethers.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.150
You should at least come to one.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.110
I don't feel like going.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.630
I don't want to remember anything 
about my current class.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:09:59.600
But...

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.140
It has nothing to do with you, Kominato-kun.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.240
Welcome back, Futaba.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.960
You were out a while.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.930
<i>Your friends-in-name-only...</i>

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:20.970
This makeup's pretty great, huh?

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.210
Huh? Which one?

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:24.690
This one! I think it'd 
look great on you, Asumi.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.640
<i>Even if they are in name only...</i>

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.770
No way!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:27.730
Just try it on!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.360
What are you looking at?

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:32.060
<i>It's much better than being alone.</i>

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:37.030
Do you have something in your pocket?

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:40.900
Oh, this? Makita-san gave it to me.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:44.770
Oh, ew! What were you talking to her for?

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.040
She was eating alone at lunch.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.690
What? All alone?

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:53.090
Well, I guess she's the type 
that gets along all right alone.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.280
Thanks for talking to me.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.140
She's got nerves of steel.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:03.410
Do you really think that's true?

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:05.850
What? What's the matter?

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.600
What's the big deal?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.120
If she doesn't want to be alone, 
she can go hang out with boys.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.190
Yeah! Some boy will take notice of her!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:16.590
She'll be fine.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.500
Anyway, it's cheating,

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.250
the way she changes personality 
when there are boys around.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.200
If you think it's cheating...

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.360
It means that deep down,

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:32.730
you want boys to think 
you're cute too, don't you?

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:39.130
If so, then instead of sniping at her,
 why don't you play cutesy, too?

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:44.790
Wha? We're not so desperate for boys' 
attention that we'll stoop to that level.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:48.100
It's not about that. 
I just hate girls like her.

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:50.390
Then you could just leave her alone!

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:54.560
But you're so jealous, you can't.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.160
Insulting someone else might make

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:00.540
you feel like you're better than them...

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.360
But you're absolutely wrong!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:14.960
<i>D-Damn it!</i>

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:28.720
J—

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:32.050
Just kidding!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.830
If you say you hate me...

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:43.820
That means you care about 
what I'm doing, right?

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:47.990
Take that!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:50.740
<i>How could she...?!</i>

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.720
What was that?

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.790
I feel sick.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.300
Futaba.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:04.220
I see what you really think of us now.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.580
<i>It's over...</i>

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:13.730
<i>I just didn't want to be alone.</i>

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:18.440
<i>That's why I worked so hard to come this far.</i>

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.360
<i>And after all that...</i>

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.440
<i>I'm way too stupid.</i>

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.360
Yoshioka-san!

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:31.850
U-Um... thank you... 
for sticking up for me.

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.270
You don't have to thank me.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:38.860
You say I was sticking up for you...

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:42.300
But I was actually sticking up for myself.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:47.180
I should really be sorry 
for dragging you into it.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.260
But it made me happy!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.940
Really. What am I doing?

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.900
<i>Why did I say that?</i>

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:14.910
<i>I've thought it all this time, 
but I kept it hidden deep inside.</i>

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:18.830
All you're doing is playing at friendship.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:20.290
It's ridiculous.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:29.680
Why are you all by yourself?

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:33.260
What happened to your friends?

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.800
I-It's because you said that thing to me!

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:43.230
You, Tanaka-kun! Because you said 
I was playing at friendship!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.690
It's my fault?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:51.660
No.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.620
It's my fault.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.830
I got so lost in pursuing my goal...

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:04.120
I didn't see what was really important.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:08.050
Emotional connections. Trust.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.510
It's my fault.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:18.450
Sorry for taking it out on you earlier.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.430
Right.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:20.910
So...

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:29.440
<i>I'm pathetic. I keep making mistakes.</i>

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.660
Wanna hit the arcade after class?

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.540
<i>People!</i>

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.730
You're still there!

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:41.160
Well...

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:44.040
<i>From that direction, too!</i>

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.700
Jeez. School's no place to be flirting.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:08.020
<i>He hid it from them, but...!</i>

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:14.990
<i>Mixed with the smell of cologne... 
that familiar smell.</i>

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:27.440
You got lost in pursuing your goal?

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:34.880
I guess you were working so hard, 
you lost sight of that goal.

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:53.680
T-Tanaka-kun... are you being 
nice to me? Or teasing me?

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:58.620
I don't know. I just did what I wanted to.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.930
And... stop calling me Tanaka already.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:06.940
I'm going.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:12.480
<i>It might be painful for him 
when I call him Tanaka-kun.</i>

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:18.460
<i>But I feel like if I ever call him "Mabuchi,"
 then the Tanaka-kun I knew...</i>

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:22.880
<i>...really will disappear completely.</i>

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.500
<i>It's lonely.</i>

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.230
Kou!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.730
Calling me by my first name already?

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:36.200
Then should I use -kun? 
Would Kou-kun be better?

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:40.410
I don't care either way. Do as you like.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.920
Scary...

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:50.640
<i>But, he didn't tell me I was wrong for 
calling him by his first name.</i>

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.550
<i>He didn't... say no.</i>

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:05.930
<i>I haven't been able to bring myself 
to talk to Asumi and Chie since then.</i>

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.030
<i>Time passed...</i>

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:17.610
<b>Completion Ceremony</b>

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:16.560
Rise!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.610
Bow!

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.570
It's over!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.080
Yeah!

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:26.000
<i>Is it okay to leave it like this?</i>

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:32.510
<i>But... there was a good chance we'd be 
put into different classes anyway...</i>

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:39.220
Asumi!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.180
Chie-chan!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.500
What?

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.640
L-Listen...

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:51.760
I-I'm sorry about before. 
I shouldn't have said it the way I did.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.110
But...

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.020
That is how I feel.

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:05.940
I didn't tell you the truth because 
I didn't want you to hate me, but...

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:11.500
That is... how I really feel.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.830
I know how you feel, Futaba.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:25.180
And I thought... if that's how you feel,

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.100
I think I really don't want to deal with you.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:32.400
No offense to you or anything...

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:38.360
I just don't think you fit in with us, so...

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.810
Bye-bye.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:45.190
A-Asumi! Wait!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.600
Yoshioka-san.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:01.060
When I was little, my teacher said...

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:05.940
"You should get along with your friends."

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:11.060
At the time, I thought it was right 
to just pursue that at any cost.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:15.680
But... sometimes it doesn't go well, does it?

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.710
My teacher didn't tell me...

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.570
Sometimes you compromise, 
and it still doesn't work out.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:27.510
Yoshioka-sa—

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:30.750
There are some things you just 
can't help! That's right!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:35.710
I...

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:41.170
I've wanted to talk to you 
about a lot of other things.

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:43.880
Me, too!

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.230
See you!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.810
Yeah... Bye-bye!

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.000
<i>In that moment, I learned something 
I had never been taught.</i>

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:02.290
<i>To come to a clear decision takes strength.</i>

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.800
<i>I learned that today.</i>

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:10.160
<i>I know I'm stronger than I was in those days.</i>

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:22.940
<i>Why do I suddenly... feel this... 
powerful desire to see Kou?</i>

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:28.050
<i>Not the Tanaka-kun I knew in middle 
school... but Kou, as he is now...</i>

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:34.370
<i>That feeling, in that moment, like I had 
something in common with Kou...</i>

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:36.030
<i>I want to feel it again!</i>

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:45.040
Maybe he went home already?

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.390
Who are you looking for?

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:55.930
Kou!

